title: WatchingAnime
---

<<set $Goblin = GetPartDisplayName("Goblin")>>
<<set $Lady = GetPartDisplayName("Lady")>>
<<set $Soldier = GetPartDisplayName("Soldier")>>
<<set $Wiki = GetPartDisplayName("Wiki")>>
<<set $Hiki = GetPartDisplayName("Hiki")>>

{$Goblin}: Would you look at this beauty. Isn't it wonderful?
{$Hiki}: I think I've seen this before. Its a computer!
{$Goblin}: Bingo-bongo, kid. This baby's a one-stop anime machine!
{$Hiki}: Anime?
{$Soldier}: What is the meaning of this, Goblin? Have you forgotten your task?
{$Goblin}: Relax, stiff. Boss needs the relief.
{$Goblin}: What should we watch, Hiki?
{$Lady}: Something cozy! 
{$Wiki}: Something informative
{$Soldier}: Something with bloodshed.
-> Something cozy
    <<jump SomethingCozy>>
-> Something informative
    <<jump SomethingInformative>>
-> Something bloody
    <<jump SomethingBloody>>
